; Internal V walls — V[col,row]: from (90+(col+1)*20, 70+row*20) to (90+(col+1)*20, 70+row*20+20)
; V(0,0)
G0 X110.000 Y70.000 F3000
G0 Z0.000 F3000 ; pen down
G1 X110.000 Y90.000 F1500
G0 Z3.000 F3000 ; pen up
